1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,924
Economists have a name for all of this.

2
00:00:04,924 --> 00:00:06,375
Goodhart's law:

3
00:00:06,375 --> 00:00:08,058
when a measure becomes a target,

4
00:00:08,058 --> 00:00:10,099
it stops being a good measure.

5
00:00:10,349 --> 00:00:12,567
So next time someone offers you a reward,

6
00:00:12,567 --> 00:00:14,772
ask what it's really paying for.

7
00:00:14,772 --> 00:00:16,177
And if you're the one paying —

8
00:00:16,177 --> 00:00:17,419
pay for the result.

9
00:00:17,419 --> 00:00:18,627
Not the number.
